scripts/session-entry-gate.md:57:Detached HEAD reports `IS_MAIN=true` with empty `CURRENT_BRANCH`; continuation is never keyed on `IS_MAIN=false` or on a non-empty current branch. Only `IS_USER_BRANCH=true` or `/design`'s `branch_info_supplied=true` path opts into continuation, so detached HEAD falls through to `strict` and `preflight.sh` fails closed.
