docs/run-logs.md:55:`<RUN_ID>` is the UUID assigned at the start of each `/implement` session. Batch payload files under a run directory are redacted for secrets and tmpdir paths before commit. `manifest.json` schema version 2 keeps `operator_cwd` / `operator_repo_root` only as stable redacted placeholders (`"<OPERATOR_CWD>"`, `"<REPO_ROOT>"`) so committed logs preserve schema shape without exposing operator-local absolute paths.
