skills/fix-issue/SKILL.md:134:2. **Best-effort terminal title rename** to `[DONE]` for lifecycle consistency. On this path Step 2 runs **before** Step 4 acquires `IN PROGRESS` — there is no `[IN PROGRESS]` title prefix from this skill to strip (rename still uses `--state done` with round-trip detection).
