skills/fix-issue/SKILL.md:341:Idempotent and best-effort: on `FAILED=true` or non-zero exit, log to `Tool Failures` and continue. Without this rename, a closed NON_PR issue would persist with the misleading `[IN PROGRESS]` title prefix until manually edited (because `/implement` Step 12a/12b/18 terminal renames only run on the PR delegation path).
