skills/issue/SKILL.md:475:- Explicit `--sentinel-file <path>` → `SENTINEL_PATH=<path>`, `SENTINEL_PATH_EXPLICIT=true`. Parent owns lifecycle.
skills/issue/SKILL.md:503:**Backward compatibility**: existing `/issue` callers that do not pass `--sentinel-file` are unaffected — the child-local default sentinel is written and removed in the same run by Step 9 cleanup, so `/tmp` does not accumulate sentinel files. Callers that pass `--sentinel-file` (e.g. `/research`) own the path and the lifecycle.
